  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "False-positive fixes from scanning more large open-source apps: LC007 and LC010 skip loops that cannot run their query or save twice (a foreach over a LanguageExt Option, a body that always returns, throws or breaks, a call followed by an exit); LC011 keys UsingEntity join entities declared in applied IEntityTypeConfiguration classes; LC035 accepts Filter(predicate) and parameterless Clear/Purge/Truncate/Wipe methods that delete a whole table. Both packages now carry SLSA build provenance attestations (gh attestation verify), and the release workflows are audited with zizmor. New coverage tests pin previously untested shapes for LC002, LC004, LC013, LC014, LC016, LC017, LC025, LC031, LC032, LC035, LC039, LC040, LC041, LC042, LC045, LC048, LC049, LC050, LC051, LC055, LC062, LC063 and the scanner, with no behavior change.",
